{
    "title": "Holy Bible - KJV+Verse",
    "description": "The Holy Bible, King James Version (KJV), offers a powerful Bible study experience with audios & verses that allows you to delve into the KJV Bible, read daily verses, listen to daily audios, play Bible trivia quiz games, and communicate with God through prayer, completely FREE.\r\n\r\nThe Holy Bible(KJV) is a lightweight app for your daily spiritual journey. Quickly access Bible verses, create highlights, bookmarks, and notes. Enjoy the KJV Bible audio feature and share your discoveries with friends. Experience God's Word together with the King James Version Bible audio.\r\n\r\nPlease join our online Bible study group to learn more about the Holy Bible.\r\n\r\n\u2712\ufe0f1. DAILY BIBLE VERSE\r\nThese are power pack inspirational KJV Bible verses that you can meditate on daily. Use this KJV Bible app for your daily devotional study and Christian bible reading. Prayer and Read Bible every day with the help of the King James Bible Version (KJV) app.\r\nRead the daily verses to stay connected with God and nourish your soul.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb52. PREFECT BIBLE AUDIO\r\nListen to the Bible audio and free your hands in this King James Version Bible application.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd63. ENGAGING BIBLE QUIZ & \"\"\"\"SPOT THE DIFFERENCES\"\"\"\" GAME\r\nBetter access to Bible quizzes and the \"\"\"\"Spot the Differences\"\"\"\" Bible game, immersing you deeper into the world of the Bible, refreshing your Bible Knowledge through easy games.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd254.Cinematic BIBLE STORY VIDEOS\r\nYou can enjoy a visually engaging way to experience the timeless stories and lessons from the Bible.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd65.Expanded knowledge and exploration of Bible history\r\nThe interesting Bible fun facts can broaden your knowledge and enrich your understanding. \r\nYou can discover significant historical events with \"\"\"\"Today in History.\"\"\"\"\r\n\r\n\u2712\ufe0f6. BOOKMARK\r\nCatch up where you left off with a simple bookmark in the KJV Bible.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0e7. QUICK SEARCH\r\nYou can quick search for any book or term by using our fast and efficient search system in the KJV Holy Bible.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea98.CUSTOMIZED READING PLAN\r\nYou can choose the suitable Bible reading plan in this app for you to finish reading the full King James Version Bible.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc969.EFFORTLESS VERSE SHARING\r\nShare KJV Bible verses together with your friends and family via multiple platforms with ease. You can easily share the verses on any social media.\r\n\r\n\u25aa The ability to add your own prayer items to COMMUNICATE WITH GOD;\r\n\u25aa BIBLE TRIVIA QUIZZES to test your knowledge;\r\n\u25aa Continuous study for PERSONAL GROWTH;\r\n\u25aa SHARE KJV Bible VERSES with friends at any time;\r\n\u25aa Habit-forming functions to help develop a daily routine of study and prayer;\r\n\u25aa PERSONALIZED reading options, including font and background choices, and note-taking capabilities;\r\n\u25aaAUDIO VERSIONS of the entire KJV Bible for listening during rest or exercise;\r\n\u25aaTHEME-BASED study plans guiding you through Bible verses;\r\n\u25aa BIBLE STORY VIDEOS provide an immersive experience;\r\n\u25aa Interesting BIBLE FUN FACTS to broaden your knowledge and enrich your understanding;\r\n\u25aa Discover significant historical events with \"\"\"\"TODAY IN HISTORY.\"\"\"\"\r\n\r\nFor any inquiries or assistance, please feel free to contact us at developerfeedback11@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Holy Bible, King James Version (KJV), offers a powerful Bible study experience with audios &amp; verses that allows you to delve into the KJV Bible, read daily verses, listen to daily audios, play Bible trivia quiz games, and communicate with God through prayer, completely FREE.<br><br>The Holy Bible(KJV) is a lightweight app for your daily spiritual journey. Quickly access Bible verses, create highlights, bookmarks, and notes. Enjoy the KJV Bible audio feature and share your discoveries with friends. Experience God&#39;s Word together with the King James Version Bible audio.<br><br>Please join our online Bible study group to learn more about the Holy Bible.<br><br>\u2712\ufe0f1. DAILY BIBLE VERSE<br>These are power pack inspirational KJV Bible verses that you can meditate on daily. Use this KJV Bible app for your daily devotional study and Christian bible reading. Prayer and Read Bible every day with the help of the King James Bible Version (KJV) app.<br>Read the daily verses to stay connected with God and nourish your soul.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb52. PREFECT BIBLE AUDIO<br>Listen to the Bible audio and free your hands in this King James Version Bible application.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd63. ENGAGING BIBLE QUIZ &amp; &quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;SPOT THE DIFFERENCES&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot; GAME<br>Better access to Bible quizzes and the &quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;Spot the Differences&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot; Bible game, immersing you deeper into the world of the Bible, refreshing your Bible Knowledge through easy games.<br><br>\ud83d\udd254.Cinematic BIBLE STORY VIDEOS<br>You can enjoy a visually engaging way to experience the timeless stories and lessons from the Bible.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd65.Expanded knowledge and exploration of Bible history<br>The interesting Bible fun facts can broaden your knowledge and enrich your understanding. <br>You can discover significant historical events with &quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;Today in History.&quot;&quot;&quot;&quot;<br><